// Stan interfejsu wspólny dla wszystkich kart: dane z Rusta (modele, teksty, obrazy map) i polecenia
// (App.cmd – jedno wejście dla wszystkich akcji, jak w OpenDTP).

export struct KV {
    k: string,
    v: string,
}

export struct LogV {
    time: string,
    text: string,
}

export struct EngineV {
    label: string,
    main: string,
    sub: string,
    level: float,
}

export struct LiveV {
    has-data: bool,
    title: string,
    category: string,
    source: string,
    phase: string,
    on-ground: bool,
    paused: bool,
    alt: string,
    alt-unit: string,
    agl: string,
    ias: string,
    tas: string,
    gs: string,
    mach: string,
    vs: string,
    vs-value: float,
    hdg: string,
    trk: string,
    pitch: float,
    bank: float,
    position: string,
    nearest: string,
    wind: string,
    oat: string,
    qnh: string,
    fuel: string,
    fuel-level: float,
    ap-line: string,
    ap-master: bool,
    ap-alt: string,
    ap-hdg: string,
    ap-spd: string,
    ap-vs: string,
    com1: string,
    com2: string,
    nav1: string,
    nav2: string,
    xpdr: string,
    gear: string,
    flaps: string,
    spoilers: string,
    brake: bool,
    lights: string,
    next-wp: string,
    next-dist: string,
    next-ete: string,
    dest-ete: string,
    wp-progress: float,
    sim-time: string,
    touchdown: string,
    controlled-by: string,
}

export struct FlightV {
    id: string,
    date: string,
    month: string,
    time: string,
    from: string,
    to: string,
    aircraft: string,
    category: string,
    duration: string,
    distance: string,
    max-alt: string,
    score: int,
    grade: string,
    landings: int,
    source: string,
    favorite: bool,
    tags: string,
    notes: bool,
    selected: bool,
    header: bool,
}

export struct LandingV {
    title: string,
    score: int,
    grade: string,
    vs: string,
    g: string,
    runway: string,
    along: string,
    notes: string,
    at: string,
}

export struct MarkerV {
    t: int,
    time: string,
    label: string,
    pos: float,
}

export struct LabelV {
    x: float,
    y: float,
    text: string,
    kind: int,
}

export struct ChartV {
    // Ścieżki SVG w układzie 1000×100 (oś czasu × wartość).
    alt: string,
    spd: string,
    gs: string,
    vs: string,
    ground: string,
    grid: string,
    y-labels: [LabelV],
    x-labels: [LabelV],
    y2-labels: [LabelV],
    markers: [LabelV],
    has-ias: bool,
    has-vs: bool,
}

export struct DetailV {
    id: string,
    title: string,
    route: string,
    subtitle: string,
    aircraft: string,
    category: string,
    from: string,
    to: string,
    duration: string,
    distance: string,
    max-alt: string,
    avg-gs: string,
    max-gs: string,
    max-vs: string,
    min-vs: string,
    points: string,
    source: string,
    notes: string,
    tags: string,
    favorite: bool,
    in-trash: bool,
    score: int,
    grade: string,
    cursor-info: string,
    cursor-pos: float,
}

export struct BarV {
    label: string,
    value: float,
    text: string,
    accent: bool,
}

export struct NavV {
    apt: bool,
    vor: bool,
    ndb: bool,
    vor-rose: bool,
    rose: bool,
    rings: bool,
    vector: bool,
    track: bool,
    route: bool,
    curtain: bool,
    rwy: bool,
    tool: int,
    view3d: bool,
    cam: int,
    inbound: bool,
    has-ref: bool,
    has-sel: bool,
    has-data: bool,
}

export struct InstrV {
    style: int,
    style-name: string,
    layout: int,
    range: string,
    rose: bool,
    apt: bool,
    vor: bool,
    ndb: bool,
    has-data: bool,
    title: string,
}

export struct RowV {
    name: string,
    a: string,
    b: string,
    level: float,
    id: string,
}

export struct StatsV {
    flights: string,
    hours: string,
    distance: string,
    landings: string,
    avg-score: string,
    avg-vs: string,
    airports: string,
    aircraft: string,
    since: string,
    longest: string,
    farthest: string,
    highest: string,
    softest: string,
    best: string,
    longest-id: string,
    farthest-id: string,
    highest-id: string,
    softest-id: string,
    best-id: string,
}

export struct AptV {
    ident: string,
    name: string,
    place: string,
    kind: string,
    extra: string,
    cat: string,
}

export struct RwyV {
    ident: string,
    length: string,
    surface: string,
    heading: string,
    wind: string,
    head: float,
    cross: float,
    best: bool,
    ils: string,
}

export struct FreqV {
    kind: string,
    name: string,
    mhz: string,
}

export struct GroupV {
    token: string,
    meaning: string,
}

export struct WxV {
    icao: string,
    name: string,
    cat: string,
    raw: string,
    wind: string,
    vis: string,
    temp: string,
    qnh: string,
    age: string,
}

export struct ProcV {
    name: string,
    info: string,
    kind: int,
}

export struct LegV {
    fix: string,
    kind: string,
    alt: string,
    speed: string,
    course: string,
    dist: string,
}

export struct DevV {
    token: string,
    name: string,
    ip: string,
    status: string,
    last-seen: string,
    last-sync: string,
    connected: bool,
    controlling: bool,
    session: string,
}

export struct OptV {
    id: string,
    label: string,
}

export global App {
    // 0 Pulpit, 1 Na żywo, 2 Dziennik, 3 Statystyki, 4 Lotniska, 5 Narzędzia, 6 Telefony, 7 Ustawienia
    in-out property <int> tab: 0;
    in-out property <bool> maximized;
    in property <string> version;
    callback win(int);
    callback cmd(string, string);
    // Zdarzenia mapy: id mapy (0 na żywo, 1 lot, 2 lotnisko, 3 statystyki), rodzaj, x, y, dx, dy.
    callback map-event(int, string, float, float, float, float);
    pure callback calc(string, [string]) -> [string];

    // Pasek stanu i Pulpit
    in property <bool> sim-connected;
    in property <string> sim-status;
    in property <string> sim-name;
    in property <bool> simulation;
    in property <int> phones;
    in property <string> phones-text;
    in property <bool> recording;
    in property <string> recording-text;
    in property <string> pairing-code;
    in property <string> addresses;
    in property <string> port;
    in property <string> db-status;
    in property <string> toast;
    in property <int> toast-serial;
    in property <bool> link-ok: true;
    in property <string> update-text;
    // Okno potwierdzenia (usuwanie, unieważnianie): pusty tekst = ukryte
    in property <string> confirm-text;
    in property <string> confirm-label;
    in property <bool> busy;
    in property <string> busy-text;
    in property <bool> update-ready;

    // Na żywo
    in property <LiveV> live;
    in property <[EngineV]> engines;
    in property <image> map-live;
    in property <[LabelV]> map-live-labels;
    in property <image> pfd;
    // Przyrządy
    in property <InstrV> instr;
    in property <image> instr-pfd;
    in property <image> instr-nd;
    in property <image> instr-panel;
    in property <image> instr-engines;
    // Mapa nawigacyjna i 3D
    in property <NavV> nav;
    in property <image> map-nav;
    in property <[LabelV]> map-nav-labels;
    in property <string> map-nav-scale;
    in property <[KV]> nav-info;
    in property <[RowV]> nav-airports;
    in property <[RowV]> nav-vors;
    in property <string> nav-tool-title;
    in property <[KV]> nav-tool;
    in property <string> nav-hover;
    in-out property <string> nav-query;
    in-out property <bool> follow: true;
    in property <string> map-live-scale;
    in property <string> map-attribution: "© Esri, HERE, Garmin, © OpenStreetMap";

    // Dziennik
    in property <[FlightV]> flights;
    in property <string> flights-summary;
    in-out property <string> filter-text;
    in-out property <int> sort-by: 0;
    in-out property <int> filter-period: 0;
    in-out property <bool> filter-favorites;
    in-out property <bool> show-trash;
    in property <int> trash-count;
    in property <bool> has-detail;
    in property <DetailV> detail;
    in property <[LandingV]> detail-landings;
    in property <[MarkerV]> detail-markers;
    in property <ChartV> chart;
    in property <image> map-flight;
    in property <[LabelV]> map-flight-labels;
    in-out property <float> replay: 0;
    in property <bool> replay-playing;
    in-out property <int> chart-mode: 0;
    in property <int> selected-count;

    // Statystyki
    in property <StatsV> stats;
    in property <[BarV]> stats-months;
    in property <[BarV]> stats-scores;
    in property <[RowV]> stats-aircraft;
    in property <[RowV]> stats-airports;
    in property <[RowV]> stats-routes;
    in property <image> map-stats;
    in-out property <int> stats-metric: 0;

    // Lotniska i pogoda
    in-out property <string> airport-query;
    in property <[AptV]> airport-results;
    in property <bool> has-airport;
    in property <AptV> airport;
    in property <[KV]> airport-info;
    in property <[RwyV]> airport-runways;
    in property <[FreqV]> airport-freqs;
    in property <string> metar-raw;
    in property <[GroupV]> metar-groups;
    in property <[KV]> metar-summary;
    in property <string> taf-raw;
    in property <[GroupV]> taf-groups;
    in property <[string]> metar-history;
    in property <string> weather-status;
    in property <image> map-airport;
    in property <[LabelV]> map-airport-labels;
    in property <[AptV]> airport-nearby;
    in property <[WxV]> watchlist;
    in property <bool> airport-watched;
    in-out property <int> airport-view: 0;
    in property <[ProcV]> procedures;
    in property <string> procedures-status;
    in property <[LegV]> procedure-legs;
    in property <string> procedure-title;

    // Telefony
    in property <[DevV]> devices;
    in property <[LogV]> activity;
    in property <int> look-sensitivity: 100;

    // Ustawienia
    in property <int> theme-mode;
    in property <[OptV]> languages;
    in property <int> language-index;
    in property <bool> record-flights: true;
    in property <int> record-interval;
    in property <bool> autostart;
    in property <bool> start-minimized;
    in property <bool> close-to-tray: true;
    in property <int> units-alt;
    in property <int> units-speed;
    in property <int> map-style;
    in property <bool> auto-sync: true;
    in property <string> data-path;
    in property <string> logbook-size;
    in property <string> about;
}
